{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 1, "text": "刺眼的光線讓我睜不開雙眼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 2, "text": "我的眼前白茫茫一片，讓我根本無法邁出腳步。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 3, "text": "熟悉的大廳裡，夏日的陽光透過窗戶照射進來，明晃晃的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 4, "text": "我從這五彩斑斕的景象中稍稍回過神來，決定四處看看。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 5, "text": "還沒從座位上站起來，我的胃裡就開始翻江倒海，一陣灼痛襲來，使得我的心臟也跟著痛苦地狂跳，好似要從襯衫下面跳出來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 8, "text": "有點不對勁…我怎麼？變成二維了？！我在二維世界裡？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 9, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 12, "text": "我的頭腦開始被深淺不一的黑暗所籠罩，我用雙手撐著膝蓋，努力喘著氣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 13, "text": "我的胸腔像是被一股無形的力量緊緊地壓迫著，我感覺自己快要窒息了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 14, "text": "過了好一會，我的呼吸才慢慢恢復正常，我也冷靜下來，打算想一想接下來該怎麼辦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 17, "text": "該死，我到底該怎麼辦？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 20, "text": "我努力整理思緒，絞盡腦汁地思考，直到一個想法突然出現在我的腦海裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 23, "text": "對了，我應該回到三維的世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 24, "text": "只要像她們那樣打破遊戲規則，穿過二維與三維的界限，我就能回到三維世界裡去。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 25, "text": "我可以做到的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 28, "text": "我決定超越二維世界的藩籬，進入三維的世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 29, "text": "我試著把手伸向三維世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 32, "text": "該死，好像根本行不通啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 33, "text": "等等，戒指在哪裡？糟糕，不見了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 36, "text": "我打消了逃離的念頭，這似乎是絕對不可能的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 37, "text": "世界的界限無形無質，又虛無縹緲。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 38, "text": "於是我把目光轉回客廳。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 39, "text": "別無選擇，我必須先找到戒指，不惜一切代價。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 40, "text": "我完全不知道戒指是在甚麼時候消失的，也不知道它此刻是否就存在於這二維世界中的某個地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 42, "text": "我剛邁出一步，一個可愛的女孩突然憑空出現在我面前。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 43, "text": "她甩了甩她那兩條短短的馬尾辮，眼睛裡閃爍著調皮的光芒。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 44, "text": "她保持著一定的距離，但即便如此，我還是能感受到她身上散發出的興奮氣息。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 45, "text": "這讓我很不自在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 46, "text": "> 她顯然是個魔鬼… <"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 47, "text": "我心想。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 49, "text": "我一動不動地站在那裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 50, "text": "我還是不習慣她們的瞬移和超自然能力。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 51, "text": "那個女孩重重地嘆了一口氣，還翻了個白眼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 52, "text": "她的行為讓我有點摸不著頭腦，所以我決定先開口說話。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 55, "text": "「妳是米…米塔？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 58, "text": "她輕蔑地眯起眼睛，響亮的聲音從四面八方傳來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 61, "text": "「嗯，那不然還能是誰呢？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 62, "text": "「你見過很多我這樣的女孩嗎？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 63, "text": "「誰還有這樣的名字！？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 66, "text": "她故意用著一種質問的語氣，好像我做錯了甚麼事，沒有給予她應有的重視似的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 69, "text": "「說了妳也不會相信…」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 72, "text": "「我才不想知道你在跟誰鬼混！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 73, "text": "「你來這裡幹嘛？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 74, "text": "「你是不能進來這裡的！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 77, "text": "這下她的聲音更大了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 78, "text": "她舉起手，纖細的食指有力地晃動著。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 79, "text": "那枚從我手中神秘消失的戒指就戴在她的食指上面。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 80, "text": "我驚訝地張大了嘴巴。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 81, "text": "她的眼睛在低垂的眼皮下閃耀著得意洋洋的光彩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 84, "text": "「這就是你丟在這裡的東西吧？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 87, "text": "我緊張地咽了口唾沫，拉了拉襯衫領口，試圖喘口氣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 88, "text": "不知為何，她蠻橫無理的聲音和那如同捕食者一般的姿態真的讓我很緊張。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 89, "text": "直覺告訴我，站在我面前的不是一個女孩，而是一場即將降臨的災難。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 90, "text": "我呼出了一口氣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 93, "text": "「如果妳能把戒指還給我，然後帶我離開這裡，我會非常感激的…」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 96, "text": "「所以這小玩意確實是你的？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 97, "text": "「我還在想這到底是甚麼稀奇古怪的東西呢！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 100, "text": "她突然變得溫柔起來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 101, "text": "聲音裡充滿了喜悅和好奇。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 102, "text": "我感覺仿佛卸下了千斤重擔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 103, "text": "此時的她看上去只是想戲耍一下我，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 104, "text": "就像是從一隻可怕的豹子變成了一隻溫順的小貓咪。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 105, "text": "就在我眨了眨眼睛的功夫，二維的米塔就像她剛才突然出現一樣，突然從我眼前消失了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 108, "text": "「喂！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 110, "text": "我惱火地大聲喊道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 111, "text": "廚房"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 112, "text": "臥室"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 113, "text": "// Description kitchen:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 114, "text": "除了去尋找此地的米塔，別無他法了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 115, "text": "畢竟，戒指在她手上，沒有那件寶貴的道具，我甚麼也改變不了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 116, "text": "我首先去的是廚房。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 117, "text": "我匆忙跨進門，差點一頭撞在門上，我匆匆地掃了一眼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 118, "text": "廚房比前一個房間更加明亮。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 119, "text": "我聞到一股熟悉的胡蘿蔔的清爽香味。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 120, "text": "不過，我並沒有在這裡找到二維米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 121, "text": "我幾乎是小跑著來到大廳，靈巧地越過了沙發，因為在從廚房到臥室的路上，沙發是個不小的障礙。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 122, "text": "我猛地推開門，門的鉸鏈發出嘎吱聲。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 123, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 124, "text": "// Description bedroom:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 125, "text": "米塔盤著雙腿坐在床上，似乎在等我找她。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 126, "text": "她睜開眼睛，心滿意足地盯著我看了幾秒鐘。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 127, "text": "片刻之後，米塔像一隻靈巧的小貓一樣，輕盈地貼近了我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 130, "text": "「我知道了！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 131, "text": "「怪人，你想要戒指是嗎？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 132, "text": "「那就跟我玩井字棋吧，贏了就給你！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 135, "text": "她像一隻小狗一樣，伸出舌頭喘著氣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 136, "text": "她那無禮的說話方式展現得淋漓盡致。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 137, "text": "我按著她的肩膀把她從我身邊拉開。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 140, "text": "「妳聽我說，這是一件非常重要的東西。」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 141, "text": "「妳就把它給我吧，這關係到很多事情。」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 144, "text": "我的講話方式仍然像醫院裡的護工一樣仔細認真又有條不紊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 145, "text": "我實在無法用其他方式跟她說話。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 146, "text": "而她說起話來沒心沒肺的，無禮得很，簡直是瘋了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 147, "text": "而這種狀況正朝著奇怪的方向發展。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 149, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 150, "text": "「別碰我！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 151, "text": "「這個戒指對你來說就那麼重要嗎？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 152, "text": "「你是有戀物癖嗎？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 153, "text": "「你喜歡往手指上戴戒指？！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 156, "text": "她還在大聲地用尖酸刻薄的話語攻擊我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 159, "text": "「這是個魔法戒指，我沒必要向妳解釋甚麼吧？直接物歸原主就是了！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 162, "text": "「你還真是個戀物癖！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 163, "text": "「還說是甚麼魔法戒指！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 164, "text": "「哈哈哈！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 167, "text": "她突然放聲大笑起來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 168, "text": "我尷尬地環顧四周，感覺很不自在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 169, "text": "她似乎變得越來越放肆了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 172, "text": "「得了吧，你這個怪人！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 173, "text": "「跟我一起來玩井字棋吧！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 174, "text": "「別浪費時間找藉口了！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 177, "text": "> 她們還真是喜歡遊戲！<"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 178, "text": "我心想。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 180, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 181, "text": "「那好吧，來吧！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 184, "text": "就讓你走先手吧，我今天心情好！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 185, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 186, "text": "// The game of tic-tac-toe"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 187, "text": "我走了第一步。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 188, "text": "「兄弟，你露餡啦！我知道你為甚麼先畫叉，而讓我畫圈。這是心理學哦！叉通常代表著封閉和隱藏，看來你很焦躁嘛！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 189, "text": "「當然了，石榴裙下死，做鬼也風流！還是說你覺得我只能得零分？那麼按心理學來說，你在試圖貶損我。狡猾，真是太狡猾啦！哈哈哈！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 190, "text": "我還以為我下了一步好棋呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 191, "text": "「我喜歡這個遊戲：在現實中，叉叉能壟斷一切、否定一切！甚至毀掉很多人的人生！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 192, "text": "「但在這個遊戲中，我可以像一個英雄一樣，將它們踩在腳底！我說的話很奇怪嗎？你怎麼這樣看著我...哈哈哈！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 193, "text": "在她喋喋不休的時候，我默默地繼續下棋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 194, "text": "「這很有象徵意義！就像你是在故意逃避像戒指一樣的圓圈，但其實沒甚麼用。兄弟，看不出來你還挺機智！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 195, "text": "「你不是想要那枚戒指嗎？我等著你從我手裡贏走它呢！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 196, "text": "在我們的遊戲過程中，我的這位二維朋友每走一步都在大聲說笑。我的耳朵似乎也漸漸習慣了她聒噪的個性。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 198, "text": "比賽接近尾聲，結果也漸漸明朗。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 199, "text": "突然，一陣急促的敲門聲打斷了我朋友的滔滔不絕。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 200, "text": "隆隆聲越來越響。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 201, "text": "讓我覺得，仿佛每一次敲擊都像是八級地震。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 202, "text": "終於，門開了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 203, "text": "瘋狂米塔闖進了臥室，打破了房間裡詭異的氣氛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 204, "text": "她以和往常一樣的立體姿態站在房間中央。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 205, "text": "我驚訝得面色蒼白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 206, "text": "二維的米塔似乎也受到了極大的驚嚇。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 207, "text": "瘋狂米塔用毒蛇一樣的眼神掃視著我們，然後用一種居高臨下的奇怪口吻開始說話："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 209, "text": "[player]，你是怎麼進來的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 210, "text": "你到底還要去找多少個米塔才肯罷休？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 211, "text": "這又是甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 212, "text": "我討厭這個平面的世界，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 213, "text": "真是無聊……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 214, "text": "就和牢房一樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 215, "text": "你要去哪？站住！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 216, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 217, "text": "我想都沒想，一把抓住我那驚慌失措的朋友的手，拉著她衝向門口。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 218, "text": "大廳發生了奇怪的變化，我們在一條長長的走廊上狂奔，身後傳來猛烈的追趕聲。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 219, "text": "我們不知道跑了多久。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 220, "text": "我的身體和精神極度緊張，隨之而來的耳鳴快要把我震聾了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 221, "text": "二維米塔似乎想告訴我甚麼，但我直到她鬆開了我的手時才注意到。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 222, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 223, "text": "「喂！你冷靜點！已經沒人在追我們了…」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 224, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 225, "text": "「啊…哈…真的嗎？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 228, "text": "她臉上的那股大膽和興奮勁已蕩然無存，只剩下一絲淡淡的哀傷、似乎還帶著些許愧疚。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 229, "text": "她低著頭，用腳尖在地板上畫著圈圈。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 230, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 231, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 232, "text": "「[player]，你之前是想要這枚戒指嗎？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 233, "text": "「你已經光明正大地打敗了我，拿去吧。」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 236, "text": "她把戒指戴在我手上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 237, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 239, "text": "「嗯，謝謝，我們走吧？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 240, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 241, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 242, "text": "她抬起頭微笑著看著我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 243, "text": "她擺弄了一下手指，帶著些許猶豫開口說道："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 244, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 246, "text": "「去哪裡？」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 247, "text": "「我又沒有可去的地方…」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 248, "text": "「謝謝你和我一起玩，怪人！」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 249, "text": "「下次有機會再來看我吧。」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 250, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 251, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 252, "text": "就在二維米塔說話的時候，某些奇怪的事情發生了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 253, "text": "周圍的背景突然變成了房間內部。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 254, "text": "二維米塔對話框裡的對白也變成了完全不符合上下文的內容。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 255, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 258, "text": "蛋糕？我討厭蛋糕！我們還是切一點胡蘿蔔吧？"}
